msgid ""
"<small>• Edit the <b>#</b> or use <b>Move up / Move down</b> to order groups.\n"
"• <b>Double-click a group</b> (or Open) to sort its stations and separators.\n"
"• Use <b>Transfer...</b> to merge or move content to another group.\n"
"• Use <b>New group</b> to add a station folder.</small>"
msgstr ""
"<small>• Guruhlarga buyurtma berish uchun <b>#</b> belgisini o'zgartiring yoki <b>Yuqoriga / Pastga siljitish</b> dan foydalaning. \n"
" • Radio va ajratgichlarni saralash uchun <b>guruh ustiga ikki marta bosing</b> (yoki Ochish). \n"
" • Kontentni birlashtirish yoki boshqa guruhga ko‘chirish uchun <b>Transfer...</b> dan foydalaning. \n"
" • Radio jildini qo‘shish uchun <b>Yangi guruh</b> dan foydalaning.</small>"

msgid ""
"<small>• Edit the <b>#</b> or use <b>Move up / Move down</b> to order stations.\n"
"• Click <b>Check streams</b> to find broken links (red) and repair them.\n"
"• Click <b>Repair stream...</b> to search Radio-Browser for a working replacement stream.\n"
"• Click <b>Separator</b> to insert a section header.</small>"
msgstr ""
"<small>• Radiolarni saralash uchun <b>#</b> belgisini o'zgartiring yoki <b>Yuqoriga / Pastga siljitish</b> tugmasidan foydalaning. \n"
" • O'lik havolalarni (qizil) aniqlash va ularni tuzatish uchun <b>Tasmalarni tekshirish</b> tugmasini bosing. \n"
" • Radio-brauzerda almashtiriladigan faol oqimni qidirish uchun <b>Oqimni tuzatish...</b> tugmasini bosing. \n"
" • Bo‘lim sarlavhasini kiritish uchun <b>Separator</b> tugmasini bosing.</small>"

msgid "<i>Sélectionnez un fichier ou un exemple ci-dessus.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Yuqoridagi fayl yoki misolni tanlang.</i>"

msgid ""
"<small>• Modifiez le <b>#</b> ou utilisez <b>Monter / Descendre</b> pour ordonner les groupes.\n"
"• <b>Double-cliquez sur un groupe</b> (ou Ouvrir) pour trier ses radios et séparateurs.\n"
"• Utilisez <b>Déplacer vers...</b> pour fusionner ou déplacer du contenu.\n"
"• Utilisez <b>Nouveau groupe</b> pour créer un dossier de radios.</small>"
msgstr ""
"<small>• Guruhlarga buyurtma berish uchun <b>#</b> belgisini o'zgartiring yoki <b>Yuqoriga / Pastga siljitish</b> dan foydalaning. \n"
" • <b>Guruhni ikki marta bosing</b> (yoki Ochish) uning radiolari va ajratgichlarini saralash. \n"
" • Kontentni birlashtirish yoki ko‘chirish uchun <b>Ko‘chirish...</b> funksiyasidan foydalaning. \n"
" • Radiolar papkasini yaratish uchun <b>Yangi guruh</b> dan foydalaning.</small>"

msgid ""
"<small>• Modifiez le <b>#</b> ou utilisez <b>Monter / Descendre</b> pour ordonner les radios.\n"
"• Cliquez sur <b>Vérifier les flux</b> pour repérer les liens hors-ligne (en rouge).\n"
"• Cliquez sur <b>Réparer le flux...</b> pour chercher un flux de remplacement actif.\n"
"• Cliquez sur <b>Séparateur</b> pour insérer un intertitre ou trait de séparation.</small>"
msgstr ""
"<small>• Radiolarga buyurtma berish uchun <b>#</b> belgisini o'zgartiring yoki <b>Yuqoriga / Pastga siljitish</b> tugmasidan foydalaning. \n"
" • Oflayn havolalarni topish uchun <b>Tasmalarni tekshirish</b> tugmasini bosing (qizil rangda). \n"
" • Faol almashtirish oqimini qidirish uchun <b>Oqimni tiklash...</b> tugmasini bosing. \n"
" • Taglavha yoki ajratuvchi qatorni kiritish uchun <b>Separator</b> tugmasini bosing.</small>"

